{"version":1,"content":"<p>據日經亞洲報道，日本政府支持的研究機構理化學研究所（RIKEN）運營的超級計算機「富嶽」（Fugaku）近日遭遇網絡安全入侵，攻擊者未經授權訪問了其作業系統，最多可能有<strong>4597人的個人信息及相關敏感數據遭到泄露</strong>。此次事件也暴露出日本科研機構在網絡安全投入方面存在的不足。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586912.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:02.539202+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:35:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_hash":"ffabe78938d2aecdd1d59ca3d7e0f68affdd5da744ea17db4f19ed4ccf024362","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}